message: "If you use this tool in teaching or research, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SQL Lab"
abstract: "Browser-based SQL practice for business students: queries checked against the expected result with targeted error diagnosis, relational schema and event-driven process design questions, animated step-by-step solutions, AI-assisted question authoring and SCORM export. Built for the French DCG accounting diploma (unit UE8), with an English interface and demo."
